<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>xyz.fontra.FontraPak</id>
  <name>FontraPak</name>
  <summary>Standalone desktop build of the Fontra font editor</summary>
  <developer id="xyz.fontra">
    <name>Just van Rossum</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      FontraPak is a cross-platform desktop application bundling the open-source, browser-based Fontra font editor. Fontra is developed by Black[Foundry] and Just van Rossum with support from Google Fonts.
    </p>
    <p>
      Fontra focuses on variable font technology and advanced workflows for large font projects such as CJK, offering deeper variable font integration than traditional editors. As a standalone package, FontraPak allows easy installation and use outside the browser, bringing the full editing environment to your desktop.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Full read and write support for .ufo, .designspace, .fontra, and .rcjk formats</li>
      <li>Partial read and write support for .glyphs and .glyphspackage files</li>
      <li>Read-only import for .ttf, .otf, .woff, .woff2, and .ttx files</li>
      <li>Native variable font design, multi-axis interpolation, and axis management</li>
      <li>Modern vector editing with component support and non-destructive path operations</li>
      <li>Real-time text shaping engine and OpenType feature testing</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
